                                "text": "To the examples alleged by Richardson, in his Dictionary, add the following: \"I se it by ensaunple In somer tyme on trowes; Ther some bowes ben leved, And some bereth none, There is a meschief in the more Of swiche manere bowes.\""
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "35625172-50d1-43c9-90bf-4e0c51a13c2f",
                                "sense_id": "bc40efe8-16a3-3629-b57a-619de5db849b",
                                "text": "In Scotland, that somer, was nothing but myrth; for all yead[515] with the preastis eavin at thare awin pleasur."
                            }
